abstract: >-
  Reproducible R pipeline for the methodological study quantifying the landline
  non-coverage bias of Brazil's telephone-based health surveillance system
  (Vigitel) against the National Health Survey (PNS) 2019, partitioning the
  prevalence gap into a non-coverage component and a residual, simulating five
  sampling-frame scenarios under the ADEMP framework, and validating the
  prediction against the real 2023 transition to a dual frame.
